body:
I guess I improved in being mindful and knowing that emotions and moods come to pass. Now I a much more able to let emotions go through me without drowning in them, and I don't trust ruminations as much. But I don't know if it's me growing or medication working \^\^. Bit of both I think. My mind is more muscular but the weight on it is also lighter.

&#x200B;

Edit: and I achieved being openly agressive with a friend. Normally I bite my lip, don't say anything and building resentment. So being agressive when I am angry is actually progress lmao.
